  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 191,
   "text": "Schedule Your Confidential Conflict Assessment",
   "size": "36px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "center"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 270,
   "text": "We’ll discuss your situation in depth. Don't worry.",
   "size": "30px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "center"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 380,
   "text": "In 30 to 45 minutes, I’ll help you answer:",
   "size": "26px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 416,
   "text": "What's the least disruptive, lowest-risk path?​",
   "size": "22px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 447,
   "text": "Is mediation appropriate or is coaching enough?",
   "size": "22px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 478,
   "text": "Who else needs to be involved, and who shouldn't?",
   "size": "22px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 509,
   "text": "What’s the best way to get the parties to mediation?",
   "size": "22px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 540,
   "text": "What will be included in my proposal?",
   "size": "22px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 646,
   "text": "At the end, we'll brainstorm next steps . . . that may or may not include me.",
   "size": "22px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 708,
   "text": "And that’s perfectly fine with me. I'll be happy to refer you to someone who’s a better fit.",
   "size": "22px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "start"
  },
  {
   "role": "a",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 791,
   "text": "Schedule Your Assessment",
   "size": "30px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "center"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 849,
   "text": "NOTE: If your situation is urgent, call me at 323-291-4813 or email",
   "size": "20px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "center"
  },
  {
   "role": "a",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 849,
   "text": "Therese@ThereseWhite.com",
   "size": "20px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "center"
  },
  {
   "role": "p",
   "region": "section#comp-msnhofn7",
   "y": 875,
   "text": "I answer my own phone and read my own email. Say it's urgent and I'll treat it that way.",
   "size": "20px",
   "family": "arial",
   "align": "center"
  },
  {
